1
00:01:44,112 --> 00:01:45,153
Is that your wife?

2
00:01:45,773 --> 00:01:46,773
No. Don't worry.

3
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:15,840
I'll be right back.

4
00:02:44,700 --> 00:02:45,700
Yo!

5
00:02:53,099 --> 00:02:54,100
Is something wrong?

6
00:02:55,250 --> 00:02:56,250
No, nothing.

7
00:03:18,629 --> 00:03:19,629
Nat!

8
00:03:22,322 --> 00:03:23,323
Do you smell something?

9
00:03:28,808 --> 00:03:34,936
Mine, yours...or the scent of our love?

10
00:03:35,737 --> 00:03:41,590
No...It smells awful.
Like something's rotting.

11
00:03:42,196 --> 00:03:43,876
Like this?

12
00:03:58,970 --> 00:04:00,177
Please don't hurt me.

13
00:04:00,377 --> 00:04:03,143
A wicked woman. A vile man.

14
00:04:28,990 --> 00:04:30,150
How did you get here?

15
00:04:30,296 --> 00:04:32,576
I suspect you're cheating.

16
00:04:35,250 --> 00:04:38,730
Who else would I have but you?

17
00:04:41,696 --> 00:04:42,697
Thank you.

18
00:04:58,688 --> 00:05:00,009
I smell something strange.

19
00:05:01,737 --> 00:05:03,977
Can't even remember
your first wife's scent?

20
00:05:13,750 --> 00:05:14,976
Hey! Hey!

21
00:05:25,897 --> 00:05:26,897
Khun Pam!

22
00:05:30,202 --> 00:05:32,443
Khun Pam! Khun Pam!

23
00:05:42,856 --> 00:05:43,657
Yo...

24
00:06:04,763 --> 00:06:10,210
The woman who stabbed the man to death
cried out in anger and grief.

25
00:06:15,130 --> 00:06:18,410
For killing the man
she loved with her own hands.

26
00:06:20,976 --> 00:06:26,605
And those three ghosts
watched with delight

27
00:06:27,069 --> 00:06:29,790
as the cheating couple

28
00:06:30,570 --> 00:06:33,170
lay dead in pools of blood.

29
00:06:37,936 --> 00:06:42,252
Cut! Wow, Auntie, that gave me chills.

30
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:45,901
That was amazing!
I love this episode. Thank you.

31
00:06:46,897 --> 00:06:48,897
Let's move to the next scene.

32
00:06:49,496 --> 00:06:51,772
- Thank you.
- Auntie, may I take a photo?

33
00:07:07,070 --> 00:07:08,430
What are you all doing?

34
00:07:10,617 --> 00:07:12,977
My new ghost story channel.

35
00:07:15,377 --> 00:07:16,977
Aunt Nong tells them so well.

36
00:07:20,856 --> 00:07:23,817
They're not stories.
They really happened.

37
00:07:26,817 --> 00:07:28,377
And I haven't told you this...

38
00:07:31,297 --> 00:07:32,297
You...

39
00:07:34,317 --> 00:07:35,317
You...

40
00:07:36,017 --> 00:07:37,017
And you.

41
00:07:39,837 --> 00:07:42,037
You look just like
the people in my story.

42
00:07:51,017 --> 00:07:53,610
Just rambling and getting 2,000 baht.

43
00:07:54,057 --> 00:07:55,297
Hmmm. Sweet deal.

44
00:07:55,968 --> 00:07:58,889
Auntie! Wait!

45
00:08:00,655 --> 00:08:02,936
What is it?

46
00:08:04,750 --> 00:08:07,630
Don't come here telling
stories like that again.

47
00:08:08,977 --> 00:08:13,977
I'm not making it up. You really look
like the person I saw in my vision.

48
00:08:16,563 --> 00:08:18,618
Look, your wife's here.

49
00:08:23,617 --> 00:08:26,017
Auntie!

50
00:08:27,017 --> 00:08:29,377
Auntie, I'm serious!

51
00:08:32,297 --> 00:08:33,377
Auntie...!

52
00:08:38,937 --> 00:08:42,457
Scared now?
I told you I'm a great storyteller.

53
00:08:42,537 --> 00:08:44,537
Everyone gets scared
when they hear my stories.

54
00:08:59,256 --> 00:09:00,257
You...

55
00:09:02,030 --> 00:09:03,030
You...

56
00:09:03,663 --> 00:09:04,663
You...

57
00:09:04,984 --> 00:09:06,009
You...

58
00:09:15,057 --> 00:09:18,737
Who said it's just a story?
It really happened.

59
00:09:19,776 --> 00:09:23,297
I'm furious you blamed it all on me.

60
00:09:37,537 --> 00:09:39,817
I was only kidding. Scared already?

61
00:09:41,417 --> 00:09:42,417
Aw...

62
00:10:12,631 --> 00:10:15,131
(GhostStory @Ghoststory)

63
00:10:28,456 --> 00:10:30,977
How are the views?

64
00:10:33,203 --> 00:10:35,203
Not great.

65
00:10:35,737 --> 00:10:36,836
It's still a new channel.

66
00:10:37,529 --> 00:10:39,930
People don't know it yet.
It'll take time.

67
00:10:43,377 --> 00:10:46,977
Maybe you should make content
that's more creative.

68
00:10:47,130 --> 00:10:49,130
Something that's more you.

69
00:10:51,930 --> 00:10:56,490
But ghost stories and miracles
get the highest views.

70
00:10:58,435 --> 00:11:02,977
Once I get enough followers,
I can build a new career

71
00:11:03,995 --> 00:11:06,850
and earn money online.

72
00:11:10,836 --> 00:11:14,036
My event company hasn't had work
for over a year.

73
00:11:15,216 --> 00:11:16,537
And there's still the debt.

74
00:11:20,456 --> 00:11:23,977
Whatever you decide,
I'll always support you.

75
00:11:26,657 --> 00:11:30,377
We'd have some cash
if Khun Pam doesn't change her mind

76
00:11:30,377 --> 00:11:32,057
about buying my old house in Ayutthaya.

77
00:11:37,697 --> 00:11:38,777
Don't let it get to you.

78
00:12:36,016 --> 00:12:37,017
Nat.

79
00:12:43,384 --> 00:12:47,704
I'm sorry.
I've been really stressed lately.

80
00:12:49,657 --> 00:12:51,977
It's okay. I understand.

81
00:13:22,115 --> 00:13:25,196
I've decided to buy this house.
I like it.

82
00:13:25,923 --> 00:13:28,923
It'll make a beautiful café.

83
00:13:32,912 --> 00:13:35,512
When you renovate it,

84
00:13:35,537 --> 00:13:37,547
please preserve
as much of it as possible.

85
00:13:38,910 --> 00:13:39,910
Of course.

86
00:13:41,857 --> 00:13:44,977
Sorry for telling an award-winning
architect how to do his job.

87
00:13:46,016 --> 00:13:47,977
I'm sure it'll be great.

88
00:13:48,577 --> 00:13:49,577
Thank you.

89
00:14:04,297 --> 00:14:06,497
Here's the deposit.

90
00:14:08,857 --> 00:14:11,977
I'd rather wait
until we sign the contract.

91
00:14:17,297 --> 00:14:20,577
Take it. I know you need the money.

92
00:14:26,377 --> 00:14:30,977
May I look around inside?
I didn't see everything last time.

93
00:14:31,857 --> 00:14:32,897
Of course.

94
00:14:36,217 --> 00:14:37,217
This way, please.

95
00:14:37,977 --> 00:14:38,977
Make yourself at home.

96
00:14:40,537 --> 00:14:41,537
Watch your step.

97
00:14:52,537 --> 00:14:53,537
Right this way.

98
00:15:06,977 --> 00:15:07,977
This way, please.

99
00:15:23,023 --> 00:15:25,823
- Watch your step.
- Okay.

100
00:16:16,896 --> 00:16:17,897
Khun Yo.

101
00:16:20,737 --> 00:16:22,937
What are you looking for?

102
00:16:26,336 --> 00:16:29,577
Someone was watching me...
then suddenly disappeared.

103
00:16:30,904 --> 00:16:36,350
Don't say that.
Aunt Nong's story already scared me.

104
00:16:37,877 --> 00:16:39,797
You think I'm not scared?

105
00:16:41,563 --> 00:16:46,163
Don't tell me you just...

106
00:16:47,136 --> 00:16:48,387
you saw a ghost.

107
00:17:11,937 --> 00:17:18,697
I know you don't really
want to sell this house.

108
00:17:23,776 --> 00:17:29,937
Don't worry. Even if I buy it,
it'll always be your home.

109
00:17:34,777 --> 00:17:36,697
I'm just helping.

110
00:17:36,797 --> 00:17:40,097
Buy it back whenever you're ready.

111
00:17:43,217 --> 00:17:44,417
Thank you.

112
00:17:51,297 --> 00:17:55,377
I think you know why.

113
00:18:51,297 --> 00:18:52,297
What happened?

114
00:18:53,217 --> 00:18:56,417
I don't know.
The vase suddenly fell and shattered.

115
00:18:59,337 --> 00:19:03,977
Maybe your great-grandfather
doesn't want this house sold.

116
00:19:06,879 --> 00:19:12,977
And Khun Yo said she saw
someone watching us.

117
00:19:13,976 --> 00:19:16,057
Not another ghost story, Yo.

118
00:19:16,057 --> 00:19:21,987
I'm serious, Nat. An old man was
standing in front of the house.

119
00:19:33,616 --> 00:19:36,457
Nat, this is the old man I told you about.

120
00:19:39,297 --> 00:19:40,977
Do you need something?

121
00:19:41,076 --> 00:19:44,036
Leave this place.
Don't ever come back.

122
00:19:44,736 --> 00:19:47,217
They're still here. They never left.

123
00:19:48,977 --> 00:19:49,997
What do you mean?

124
00:19:50,616 --> 00:19:52,936
Who's still here? Who hasn't left?

125
00:20:07,996 --> 00:20:10,931
(Cash - Five Million Baht Only)

126
00:20:27,897 --> 00:20:28,917
Here, have some water.

127
00:20:38,457 --> 00:20:44,257
If Whan was right, maybe your
great-grandfather doesn't want it sold.

128
00:20:46,662 --> 00:20:49,303
I think he'd rather not see
his family struggle.

129
00:20:50,437 --> 00:20:51,917
Don't overthink it.

130
00:20:52,150 --> 00:20:55,070
Let's pay off the debt
before they sue us.

131
00:20:57,343 --> 00:21:00,563
But I talked to everyone.
They understand. They're willing to wait.

132
00:21:00,977 --> 00:21:03,927
But the bank won't wait, Yo.

133
00:21:06,777 --> 00:21:08,177
Yeah... you're right.

134
00:21:12,224 --> 00:21:16,224
I should've listened to you.
I never should've started the company.

135
00:21:16,697 --> 00:21:20,977
When it failed,
I dragged you into my problems.

136
00:21:22,137 --> 00:21:24,887
You even had to help pay my debts.

137
00:21:25,537 --> 00:21:29,977
And now we're barely making ends meet.

138
00:21:31,897 --> 00:21:35,977
That's just you, Yo. So sure of yourself,
never listening to anyone.

139
00:21:37,976 --> 00:21:40,576
And I love that about you.

140
00:21:43,777 --> 00:21:46,377
No one wants a business to fail.

141
00:21:46,377 --> 00:21:50,777
You did everything you could.
The timing just wasn't right.

142
00:21:52,049 --> 00:21:54,609
Don't worry about the money.

143
00:21:55,277 --> 00:21:57,397
I'll help you out.

144
00:22:04,137 --> 00:22:06,817
Stop worrying... okay?

145
00:23:26,937 --> 00:23:28,037
Here we go.

146
00:24:32,777 --> 00:24:37,337
Nat! Your phone's ringing.
It must be urgent. It won't stop.

147
00:25:02,697 --> 00:25:03,937
Yes, Khun Pam.

148
00:25:04,137 --> 00:25:09,177
Nat, I'm ordering dinner.
Want anything?

149
00:25:09,912 --> 00:25:11,032
The usual.

150
00:25:11,077 --> 00:25:13,477
Beef basil with a fried egg, well done.
Right?

151
00:25:21,177 --> 00:25:22,177
Anything, Khun Pam?

152
00:25:23,577 --> 00:25:24,577
I miss you.

153
00:25:46,550 --> 00:25:47,910
Surprise!

154
00:25:47,970 --> 00:25:49,970
Khun Pam... I...

155
00:26:36,336 --> 00:26:37,870
(GhostStory @Ghoststory)
(6,333 followers • 39 videos)

156
00:26:37,895 --> 00:26:40,016
Why aren't the views going up?

157
00:26:55,577 --> 00:26:58,027
(Interesting Topics)

158
00:27:03,936 --> 00:27:06,016
(Interesting Topics, Strange Stories)
(What People Want to Know, Trending Topics)

159
00:28:00,803 --> 00:28:01,803
Go see!

160
00:28:05,377 --> 00:28:08,257
Yo! Yo! Are you okay?

161
00:28:09,257 --> 00:28:11,737
The lantern suddenly went out.
Darkness swallowed everything.

162
00:28:12,257 --> 00:28:16,057
Then the three ghosts
possessed the woman.

163
00:28:19,577 --> 00:28:22,477
I told you to stop making ghost videos.

164
00:28:26,697 --> 00:28:28,937
But the views are going up!

165
00:28:31,736 --> 00:28:32,977
Where were you?

166
00:28:35,257 --> 00:28:37,737
I went to check
if the front gate was locked.

167
00:28:39,137 --> 00:28:40,697
Go back to sleep.

168
00:28:42,530 --> 00:28:43,530
I had a dream...

169
00:28:45,170 --> 00:28:48,170
Someone was having sex
in our house.

170
00:28:52,017 --> 00:28:54,017
So I went downstairs...

171
00:28:54,017 --> 00:28:55,217
and...

172
00:28:56,901 --> 00:28:58,731
I saw ghosts.

173
00:29:00,017 --> 00:29:06,977
There's no such thing as ghosts.
There's nothing there. Go to sleep.

174
00:29:09,776 --> 00:29:13,536
Come on... go to sleep.

175
00:29:49,757 --> 00:29:50,757
Go see!

176
00:29:53,456 --> 00:29:54,977
Maybe it's trying
to tell us something.

177
00:30:17,537 --> 00:30:18,937
How did this happen?

178
00:30:21,297 --> 00:30:22,937
What happened, Whan?

179
00:30:25,017 --> 00:30:27,177
My boyfriend... we had a fight.

180
00:30:28,977 --> 00:30:30,977
He did this to you?

181
00:30:37,537 --> 00:30:39,457
Want to report him? I'll take you.

182
00:30:40,057 --> 00:30:45,057
Please don't, Khun Yo.
He has a terrible temper.

183
00:30:46,057 --> 00:30:51,577
Whenever he loses it,
he always takes it out on me.

184
00:30:54,897 --> 00:30:57,537
Are you going to let him
keep treating you like this?

185
00:31:03,502 --> 00:31:04,503
No.

186
00:31:07,856 --> 00:31:08,987
I'm leaving him.

187
00:31:14,096 --> 00:31:15,977
I really am.

188
00:31:35,057 --> 00:31:37,057
You're so lucky, Khun Yo.

189
00:31:39,697 --> 00:31:41,657
You have Khun Nat by your side.

190
00:31:58,937 --> 00:32:00,637
The kinder Nat is to me...

191
00:32:03,736 --> 00:32:06,057
...the guiltier I feel.

192
00:32:08,057 --> 00:32:09,557
I keep causing problems.

193
00:32:12,777 --> 00:32:14,377
Started a business. Failed.

194
00:32:17,257 --> 00:32:19,757
Now my content's flopping too.

195
00:32:20,817 --> 00:32:21,977
Who says that?

196
00:32:23,817 --> 00:32:27,177
The latest video I uploaded
is almost at a million views.

197
00:32:29,216 --> 00:32:30,217
Which one?

198
00:32:31,570 --> 00:32:34,225
The one from the ancestral house.

199
00:32:37,304 --> 00:32:41,424
I edited and posted it
as soon as I got home.

200
00:32:42,297 --> 00:32:43,977
I thought you saw it.

201
00:32:49,977 --> 00:32:51,377
Here.

202
00:32:53,937 --> 00:32:55,737
(Ancestral House Episode)
(930K views • 13 hours ago)

203
00:32:57,856 --> 00:33:02,977
Seriously? The videos I work
hardest on don't take off...

204
00:33:04,697 --> 00:33:06,017
...but this one goes viral.

205
00:33:09,257 --> 00:33:10,657
You just never know.

206
00:33:20,297 --> 00:33:21,297
Are you okay?

207
00:33:30,657 --> 00:33:32,017
Let's plate it up!

208
00:33:37,976 --> 00:33:42,296
Today's recipe will win your husband over.
Easy to make and absolutely delicious.

209
00:33:42,470 --> 00:33:44,030
Give it a try!

210
00:33:44,237 --> 00:33:47,717
Cut! Great!

211
00:33:52,177 --> 00:33:53,177
Khun Yo?

212
00:33:53,863 --> 00:33:57,663
Wouldn't it be better
if Khun Nat was in the frame too?

213
00:33:58,896 --> 00:33:59,896
No.

214
00:34:01,297 --> 00:34:05,897
The channel's called "Win Your Husband's
Heart," but no husband in sight?

215
00:34:06,977 --> 00:34:09,377
That's what I want people asking.

216
00:34:09,743 --> 00:34:13,864
The more curious they are,
the more views we get—

217
00:34:14,103 --> 00:34:17,502
just like the video
from the ancestral house.

218
00:34:17,812 --> 00:34:20,052
Did they see a ghost or not?

219
00:34:20,077 --> 00:34:26,177
"Win your husband over." Where is he?
Whose husband is he?

220
00:34:26,536 --> 00:34:30,697
Why won't he show his face?
Besides the recipes,

221
00:34:31,177 --> 00:34:33,977
people will keep watching
because they want answers.

222
00:34:35,322 --> 00:34:37,692
Won't Khun Nat mind?

223
00:34:39,536 --> 00:34:43,977
Not at all. He doesn't like being
on camera. He just likes to eat.

224
00:34:44,524 --> 00:34:48,804
He's happy just coming home
to a good meal.

225
00:34:58,577 --> 00:35:01,497
Yes, Nat. Dinner's ready!

226
00:35:01,964 --> 00:35:04,044
I still have work to finish.
I'll be up late.

227
00:35:04,649 --> 00:35:08,649
If you're sleepy, don't wait up for me.
And don't forget your medicine.

228
00:35:10,477 --> 00:35:11,677
Okay.

229
00:35:18,377 --> 00:35:23,937
Don't you think Khun Nat and Khun Pam
seem a little too close?

230
00:35:26,165 --> 00:35:28,445
They work together.

231
00:35:28,470 --> 00:35:29,870
You're not jealous?

232
00:35:31,097 --> 00:35:35,097
I trust Nat.
And Khun Pam seems like a good person.

233
00:35:35,097 --> 00:35:38,417
So you haven't watched
the whole video from the house yet?

234
00:35:39,017 --> 00:35:41,687
I caught Khun Pam
giving Khun Nat a strange look.

235
00:35:46,817 --> 00:35:47,817
Really?

236
00:36:40,737 --> 00:36:41,737
What's this stain?

237
00:36:47,417 --> 00:36:49,977
This is the shirt Nat wore to
the ancestral house.

238
00:37:52,423 --> 00:37:54,503
(Nat)

239
00:38:19,177 --> 00:38:20,697
It's nothing.

240
00:38:30,137 --> 00:38:33,817
Let this be the last time.

241
00:38:37,909 --> 00:38:42,950
I don't want to betray Yo.
Let's just stay friends, Khun Pam.

242
00:38:43,817 --> 00:38:45,377
If you really want...

243
00:38:48,337 --> 00:38:49,977
...I won't stop you.

244
00:39:33,337 --> 00:39:34,537
Go see!

245
00:39:45,023 --> 00:39:47,463
Khun Yo is probably asleep by now.

246
00:39:49,038 --> 00:39:51,718
I'm leaving for China tomorrow.

247
00:39:51,743 --> 00:39:54,423
I just wanted
a little more time with you.

248
00:39:57,617 --> 00:40:01,977
Then have a safe trip.
I'll finish the project while you're away.

249
00:40:25,697 --> 00:40:29,977
I'm really going to miss you.
See you...

250
00:40:31,256 --> 00:40:36,097
...as a friend. Or...

251
00:40:37,097 --> 00:40:38,977
just colleagues.

252
00:40:45,776 --> 00:40:46,777
Khun Pam...

253
00:40:52,217 --> 00:40:54,977
Khun Pam! Khun Pam!
Yo's home!

254
00:41:13,177 --> 00:41:14,417
Disgusting.

255
00:41:17,937 --> 00:41:19,977
I never thought
I'd have to see something like this.

256
00:41:21,737 --> 00:41:23,377
How could you do this to me, Nat?

257
00:41:24,737 --> 00:41:28,217
Yo! Yo! Yo! Wait!

258
00:41:38,596 --> 00:41:41,356
Yo! Wait!

259
00:41:43,729 --> 00:41:46,009
- Yo, I'm sorry.
- How long have you...

260
00:41:48,375 --> 00:41:49,576
...been with...?

261
00:41:51,403 --> 00:41:53,003
Yo... I...

262
00:41:54,036 --> 00:41:56,596
How long has it been?

263
00:41:57,390 --> 00:41:59,705
- Let me explain.
- I don't want to hear it!

264
00:42:01,657 --> 00:42:04,457
Khun Pam, please go home... okay?

265
00:42:04,590 --> 00:42:06,670
It takes two to tango.

266
00:42:10,457 --> 00:42:14,257
But Nat and I aren't together.
Nothing happened between us.

267
00:42:15,417 --> 00:42:20,977
Then what exactly did I just see?
I'm not stupid.

268
00:42:27,296 --> 00:42:28,632
Yo! Yo!

269
00:42:31,417 --> 00:42:32,497
Yo!

270
00:42:58,823 --> 00:43:02,503
I didn't do anything.
Your wife came after me.

271
00:43:03,897 --> 00:43:07,057
If she hadn't bumped into me,
she would've never known.

272
00:43:10,737 --> 00:43:12,977
Shameless!
Sick!

273
00:43:16,657 --> 00:43:19,977
Yo! Wait!

274
00:43:38,177 --> 00:43:45,470
Yo! Where are you going?
Wait, Yo! Wait!

275
00:43:46,589 --> 00:43:47,790
Yo. Please.

276
00:43:51,737 --> 00:43:54,177
Don't go, Yo!

277
00:44:12,776 --> 00:44:15,977
I told you to use the company car.

278
00:44:16,836 --> 00:44:20,836
Or do you want a new one?
Just name it.

279
00:44:21,457 --> 00:44:24,857
I don't want anything.
I just want Yo back.

280
00:44:25,523 --> 00:44:28,949
Think it over while I'm away.

281
00:44:30,037 --> 00:44:33,077
Figure out how to get Khun Yo
to accept us.

282
00:44:34,797 --> 00:44:36,307
There's no "us."

283
00:44:38,669 --> 00:44:44,030
Now that Yo knows,
you should think about it.

284
00:44:44,177 --> 00:44:51,177
I think you can convince her...
...to let the three of us

285
00:44:52,177 --> 00:44:54,737
be a throuple.

286
00:44:59,457 --> 00:45:03,097
If I were you,
I wouldn't bother Khun Nat about Khun Pam.

287
00:45:05,097 --> 00:45:06,217
Go home.

288
00:45:08,217 --> 00:45:10,217
I'll expose what you really are.

289
00:45:12,256 --> 00:45:13,977
Excuse me.
Is there an electrician nearby?

290
00:45:15,757 --> 00:45:19,757
You don't know, Yotaka...
Sneaking around

291
00:45:19,869 --> 00:45:23,070
is always more exciting
than what you already have.

292
00:45:23,095 --> 00:45:24,978
I promise...
I'll be the husband you deserve.

293
00:45:25,003 --> 00:45:26,504
I will not let you down.
